---
/**
 * Licence / community call-to-action band.
 */
---

<section id="community" class="community" aria-labelledby="community-title">
  <div class="wrap community-inner">
    <div>
      <h2 id="community-title">Free software, built in the open.</h2>
      <p>LibreChart is released under the GNU General Public License, version 2. That means you're free to run it, study it, share it, and improve it — for any clinic, anywhere, at no cost. Field clinicians, translators, and developers are all welcome to help shape where it goes next.</p>
      <div class="community-ctas">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/LibreChart/LibreChart" rel="noopener">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 .5A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 .5 12a11.5 11.5 0 0 0 7.86 10.92c.58.1.79-.25.79-.56v-2.1c-3.2.7-3.88-1.37-3.88-1.37-.53-1.33-1.28-1.69-1.28-1.69-1.05-.71.08-.7.08-.7 1.16.08 1.77 1.19 1.77 1.19 1.03 1.76 2.7 1.25 3.36.96.1-.75.4-1.25.73-1.54-2.55-.29-5.24-1.28-5.24-5.68 0-1.25.45-2.28 1.18-3.08-.12-.29-.51-1.46.11-3.04 0 0 .96-.31 3.15 1.18a10.9 10.9 0 0 1 5.74 0c2.18-1.49 3.14-1.18 3.14-1.18.63 1.58.24 2.75.12 3.04.74.8 1.18 1.83 1.18 3.08 0 4.41-2.69 5.38-5.25 5.67.41.36.78 1.06.78 2.14v3.17c0 .31.2.67.8.56A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 23.5 12 11.5 11.5 0 0 0 12 .5Z"/></svg>
          Browse the repository
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="license-card">
      <span class="lic-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v18M3 7l9-4 9 4M6 10v6M18 10v6M4 16h4M16 16h4"/></svg>GPL-2.0</span>
      <h3>Yours to run and adapt</h3>
      <p>Everything you need to deploy, extend, or fork LibreChart is public.</p>
      <ul class="lic-list">
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Full source code and installation docs</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Open issue tracker and discussions</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Contributor guide for code and translations</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .community{background:var(--mist);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
  .community-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}
  .community h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.4vw,2.4rem);font-weight:700}
  .community p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px;font-size:1.08rem}
  .community-ctas{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-top:28px}
  .license-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:26px 28px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
  .license-card .lic-tag{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:var(--vital-teal-dark);
    background:#E3F2EF;padding:6px 13px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .license-card .lic-tag svg{width:16px;height:16px}
  .license-card h3{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}
  .license-card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.98rem;margin-bottom:16px}
  .lic-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:10px}
  .lic-list li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:.96rem;color:var(--ink)}
  .lic-list svg{width:18px;height:18px;color:var(--vital-teal);flex:none;margin-top:2px}
  

  @media (max-width: 920px) {
    .community-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:34px}
  }
</style>
